lifeos-nix patch f-projects-no-memory-writes — retire the automatic machinery around USER/PROJECTS.md

PROBLEM
  Companion to f-projects-dormant (which stops force-loading PROJECTS.md). The memory
  system still treated PROJECTS.md as a live target: the reviewer could emit
  target_kind:"projects" proposals routed to it (MemoryTypes/MemoryReviewer), it was a
  Tier-B append-with-audit file (MutationTier), its proposals section was GC'd
  (ProposalGC), and it was freshness-nagged every 30d (TelosFreshness). Once PROJECTS.md
  is dormant/on-demand, all of that is machinery writing to / nagging about a file
  nobody force-loads — the principal reports never editing it by hand; it accreted
  purely from this autonomic path. Sever it so PROJECTS.md becomes an inert on-demand doc.

FIX (5 files) — remove the "projects" proposal kind + Tier-B/GC/freshness registrations
  MemoryTypes.ts    — drop PROJECTS_PATH, the "projects" ProposalTargetKind (union +
                      ALL_PROPOSAL_KINDS + PROPOSAL_KIND_TO_FILES), its self-test, and
                      the now-stale ALWAYS_LOADED_KINDS doc paragraph about "projects";
                      subtype count 8 -> 7.
  MemoryReviewer.ts — drop "projects" from the proposal schema union + the routing doc
                      block + the "new projects" DO-SAVE mention.
  MutationTier.ts   — drop PROJECTS.md from TIER_B_FILES + docstring + its self-test.
  ProposalGC.ts     — drop PROJECTS.md from the GC'd-proposals target list.
  TelosFreshness.ts — drop PROJECTS_PATH const, the "projects" registry entry, and the
                      "projects" default-threshold entry (would nag forever once dormant).
  NOTE: WorkSweep.ts (reads PROJECTS.md for github [Project-Check] issues) and
  ContextAudit.ts (budget-lint) are READ-only paths that go dead once PROJECTS.md is
  dormant; left as harmless no-ops rather than excised.
  RE-PORTED to upstream v7.40.4 (be9e8ef): MemoryReviewer/TelosFreshness hunks drifted
  (PR #1832 reviewer text; pai->lifeos slug rename; new ALWAYS_LOADED_KINDS scope-gate
  and default-threshold map). Regenerated fresh against 7.40.4 source.

